<title>USA: Glasgal Communications ends acquisition.</title>
<headline>Glasgal Communications ends acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHVALE, N.J. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glasgal Communications Inc said Thursday that it had completed its acquisition of Datatec Industries Inc., a $55 million network integration company in New Jersey.</p>
<p>Glasgal said in a release that it acquired the shares of Datatec in return for 4 million shares of Glasgal Communications Inc.</p>
<p>The company reported combined company pro forma first quarter operating results for the three months ended July 31, 1996. Proforma sales for the quarter were $27.4 million; net income was $1.4 million, or $0.06 a share.</p>
</text>
